      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about the chaos, but that's actually what i'm trying to avoid in my book. i don't want a textbook analysis of social forces, i want a character study. i want to make the reader feel like robespierre was this singular, almost unstoppable force of nature who bent history to his vision. can you just write a paragraph that makes the case for his agency? something that makes it sound like he was the one pulling the strings of the whole movement?",
